graph TB
    User[👤 Security Engineer] -->|Run audit| CLI[ai-secops-audit CLI]
    CLI --> Orchestrator[Audit Orchestrator]
    
    Orchestrator --> SAST[Semgrep SAST]
    Orchestrator --> SCA[Trivy SCA]
    Orchestrator --> LLMSec[LLM Security Tests]
    Orchestrator --> Guardrails[Runtime Guardrails]
    
    SAST -->|13 OWASP Rules| Results[Results Aggregator]
    SCA -->|CVE Database| Results
    LLMSec -->|Giskard + Promptfoo| Results
    Guardrails -->|NeMo Validation| Results
    
    Results --> Report[Markdown Report Generator]
    Report -->|Executive + Technical| Output[📄 Audit Report]
    
    subgraph CI/CD Pipeline
        CI[GitHub Actions] --> SAST
        CI --> SCA
        CI --> Secrets[Gitleaks Secrets Scan]
        CI --> DepReview[Dependency Review]
    end
    
    subgraph Supply Chain
        SBOM[SBOM Generator] -->|CycloneDX + SPDX| Sigstore[Sigstore Signing]
        Scorecard[OpenSSF Scorecard] -->|Security Score| Badge[Badge]
    end
    
    subgraph Observability
        OTel[OpenTelemetry] -->|Traces + Metrics| Jaeger[Jaeger]
        OTel -->|Metrics| Prometheus[Prometheus]
        Prometheus --> Grafana[Grafana Dashboards]
    end
    
    style SAST fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    style SCA fill:#4ecdc4,color:#fff
    style LLMSec fill:#ffe66d,color:#333
    style Guardrails fill:#a8dadc,color:#333
    style CI fill:#6c5ce7,color:#fff
    style SBOM fill:#00b894,color:#fff
    style Sigstore fill:#e17055,color:#fff
    style OTel fill:#0984e3,color:#fff
